SUMMARY:Community Gardeners Free Exchange
DESCRIPTION:Fall is nearly here and so is our third Community Gardeners’ Exchange🪴 \nNext Saturday\, come by the garden with your plants and gardening supplies and exchange them for new ones to start your fall garden! \nExamples of items to exchange are gloves\, seeds\, recent harvets\, plants\, cuttings\, hand tools and more \nThe exchange is a day to connect with the local gardening community\, prevent usable items from going to the landfill\, and find new gems to add to your garden!
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/community-gardeners-free-exchange/
LOCATION:Botanica Nursery and Gardens Sebastopol\, 3970 Azalea Avenue\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly),Environment/Ecology,Free,Gardening/Agriculture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Green-and-Blue-Organic-Illustrative-Playful-Gardening-Class-Event-Poster-2.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Botanica Nursery and Gardens":MAILTO:Info@botanicanurseryandgardens.com
END:VEVENT
