SUMMARY:Sonoma County Farm Trails Fall Tour
DESCRIPTION:Don’t miss our Weekend Along the Farm Trails Fall Tour on Sept. 26 & 27! Experience the magic of harvest time in Sonoma County for a self-guided tour of your choice of farms and producers to discover where your food\, fiber\, and flowers come from.\n👨‍🌾 Take farm tours\n🎃 Pick pumpkins\, apples\, veggies\, and flowers\n🐷 Meet farm animals\n🌾 Enjoy special tastings and hands-on workshops\n🚜 Go on hayrides\, scavenger hunts\, and more fun family activities\n🥕 Shop at charming farm stands\nAll ages welcome! Registration is FREE and easy! Sign up at https://farmtrailsfalltour2026.eventbrite.com
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/sonoma-county-farm-trails-fall-tour/
LOCATION:Sonoma County Farm Trails\, PO Box 452\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95473\, United States
CATEGORIES:Agriculture,All Ages (Family friendly),Food & Drink,Free
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hayride.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Farm Trails":MAILTO:farmtrails@farmtrails.org
END:VEVENT
