SUMMARY:Graton Day
DESCRIPTION:Graton Day is coming up! Join us Saturday\, September 26 from 1–5 PM at the Graton Town Square for a free\, family-friendly afternoon celebrating our little town. \nLive music\, local food\, zucchini racing\, the beloved pie baking contest\, chicken bingo\, games\, live storyreading\, and plenty of good old-fashioned block party energy. \nFree entry. All are welcome. Bring your friends\, neighbors\, kids and come spend the afternoon with us! \nRSVP and more details here:
