SUMMARY:Gravenstein Lions Chili Cookoff Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:Gravenstein Lions Chili Cook-Off Fundraiser! \nGet ready for an afternoon of great food\, fun\, and community spirit at the Gravenstein Lions Chili Cook-Off Fundraiser! \n📅 Saturday\, September 27\n🕛 12:00 PM to 4:00 PM\n📍 Sebastopol Center for the Arts \nCome sample a variety of delicious chili recipes and help support the Gravenstein Lions’ community programs. \n🎟 Admission:\n• Adults: $15\n• Kids: $5 \nYour admission includes tastings of all the chili entries! \nAdditional refreshments available for purchase:\n🍺 Beer\n🍷 Wine\n🥤 Soda\n🍦 Ice Cream \n🎁 Huge Raffle!\nDon’t miss your chance to win exciting prizes while supporting a great cause. \nBring your family\, friends\, and appetite for an afternoon of tasty competition and community fun. We look forward to seeing you there! \nSupport your community\, sample amazing chili\, and enjoy a great day at the Gravenstein Lions Chili Cook-Off Fundraiser! 🌶️🏆
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/gravenstein-lions-chili-cookoff-fundraiser/
LOCATION:282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472\, 282 S High St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472
CATEGORIES:All Ages (Family friendly)
END:VEVENT
