SUMMARY:An Evening with Medium Michael McGivern
DESCRIPTION:An Evening with Medium Michaela McGivern – September 27th / 6:30PM – 8:30PM \nclick here to register \nThese intimate conversations often serve to clarify relationships\, facilitate completion and reassure us that the loving connection between souls is always accessible. \n“Each guest is invited to ask a loved one a question or communicate a message.\nThese conversation can bring reassurance\, closure or a new perspective.\nBe prepared to be touched and inspired.” \nWith your permission\, Michaela connects with a loved one who has passed and transmit messages between the two of you. The conversation might be one to get an update on how that Spirit is doing\, clarify something that occurred\, forgive one another\, or get suggestions from the loved one about a concern you have. These conversations bring relief\, healing and a sense of peace. \nPLEASE NOTE: The EESystem™ will be turned off for this event
URL:https://sebastopolcalendar.com/event/michaela-mcgivern/
LOCATION:Energy Wave Center\, 120 PLeasant Hill Ave. N\, Suite 330\, Sebastopol\, 95472
CATEGORIES:Adults and teens,Adults only, 21 and older,Adults, generally,Spiritual
